      "09ab018e-a9d6-b549-9008-e2fbffd18c87"],
     " shows the fit of the central axes and outpu the plot as extra output."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"760186f8-59b4-a64a-87cf-9dce6154ddf1"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "e31ce7b6-5797-0f4d-8e7d-2a1d299eba26"], 
    ButtonBox["LCMMethod",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/LCMMethod"], "\"\<WallMap\>\"", Cell[
    TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["LCMMethod",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/LCMMethod"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"e87ddeb3-5352-fc41-85a1-f0abec38fc6f"],
     " is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "HelixAngleCalc"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "82293233-aab5-724a-b59a-037ca6c50345"],
     " and LMCSystemCalc. Can be \"",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CentralAxes",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CentralAxes"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"b49415d9-da02-ed4b-b656-ece640fd450b"],
     "\" or \"WallMap\". \n\"",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CentralAxes",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CentralAxes"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"e51c9aa9-188a-984e-98d2-bd34655fead1"],
     "\" uses wall distance calculation using projection of the central axes \
and circular approximation of the ventricle. This method is fairly fast and \
uses ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CentralAxes",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CentralAxes"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"35672dc0-19e6-6847-81bd-6462cc0fefcf"],
     " internally.\n\"WallMap\" uses wall distance interpolation and \
subsequential gradient calculation. Can take long for high res datasets but \
is most accurate. Uses ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CalculateWallMap",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CalculateWallMap"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"d2549eb5-b7b3-0740-aeb6-95a34ba7b201"],
     " internally."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"3799ee9a-abdf-0242-b82e-dc1685a8d24e"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "d135fda6-71ad-b143-bf2c-4852197f20a8"], 
